{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0414_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f5f8041bf214f2c7a259578692ccbc18fa965e18ad629c22c64b955d71e347b3", "ja": "（今日はオフの真と、海の近くにある\n展望台へ遊びに来ていた）", "zh": "（今天和休息中的真一起，来到了海边的展望台游玩。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0414_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "95d67536b8d801b59c85fcb9d5385c905b165b6f8e6a84debc42577053b89d53", "ja": "ん～っ、楽しかった～！\n今日は思いっきり遊び倒しましたね！", "zh": "嗯～，真开心～！\n今天真是尽情玩了个痛快呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0414_1002_p", "source_sha256": "68e278477f032608feaebef7998aa8085a29a6410c1d53ad5de786af9d58eef1", "ja": "ああ。真のおかげで、\n時間も忘れて楽しめたよ。", "zh": "嗯，多亏了真，\n玩得尽兴到连时间都忘了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0414_1003_p", "source_sha256": "e4e456b34d50cb241729f7b41e7525605e730fd02a05037d079bb5aa4afdf096", "ja": "……ただ、お互い服が乾くには\nもうちょっとかかりそうだな。", "zh": "……不过，我们俩要把衣服晾干，\n好像还得花点时间呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0414_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "67d0246a04ecd42be8ea29fd2312e4971887a3be55c221936307f252b32df2c7", "ja": "えへへ……すみません。\nでも水のかけあいも、楽しかったですよね！", "zh": "嘿嘿……不好意思。\n不过互相泼水也很开心，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0414_1005_p", "source_sha256": "28f2b6b4043b501226c35e9ac5275e4d6b8ced0c4ccb4f31875cabb49c17de46", "ja": "そうだな。\n……ちょっと大人げなかったかもしれないけど。", "zh": "是啊。\n……不过，可能确实有点不够成熟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0414_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "f596cb189098eb3af971ed74b9fcb9d87e7e1606f9e242d02a17a2e3ba81f446", "ja": "そんなことないですよ！　ボクが読んだ少女漫画じゃ、\n年上の人も気にせずにやってたから大丈夫です！", "zh": "才不是那样！我看过的少女漫画里，年长的人也毫不在意地那么做，所以没关系的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0414_1007_p", "source_sha256": "569e5df33657b9864eacd2563e71b78e6c412ac8c55bce2de9df95afbe22f3c8", "ja": "そうなのか……というか、今日ここに来たのも、\n水の掛け合いを始めたのも、もしかして……。", "zh": "原来如此……话说，今天会来这里，还有开始互相泼水，该不会也是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0414_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "3567b7a1a62a1b809d90c19bc33ddeb33ff19b51b602a429712138a042bf6c98", "ja": "あ、分かっちゃいましたか？", "zh": "啊，你已经猜到了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0414_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "88416edf627074c42986655d2adc112f400f0d47038cae6d4bf78ae52cd0cc59", "ja": "その漫画のシーン、とっても楽しそうで、\nキラキラしてて、なんだか幸せそうで……。", "zh": "那部漫画里的场景看起来特别开心，闪闪发光的，感觉好幸福……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0414_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "4725d81e797c288f15155a66a4e3d2fba7ec85cb27933fe7ab3b2a814c899e98", "ja": "それで、ボクもどんな感じなのかなーって\nちょっと体験してみたくなったんです。", "zh": "所以，我也有点想亲自体验一下，看看究竟是什么感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0414_1011_p", "source_sha256": "6b408e6d05883a2a7ed595ba70c4c669a3e9ff81e696399d63897f68e0b5bdb4", "ja": "なるほどな。\n……じゃあ、この体験は成功したってことだな。", "zh": "原来如此。\n……那么，这次体验就算成功了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0414_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "ce9e94e75886b2ed1b15988091044b8962b25800d4f4fe72d0635dc53f441d60", "ja": "はい！　もちろんです！", "zh": "好！当然没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0414_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "580ee936689f5689299df879fe34d11c7cf688cf809cdc021ce83ff367b17bf7", "ja": "成功どころか……忘れられないぐらい、\nとっても素敵な思い出になりました。", "zh": "别说是成功了……简直成了令人难以忘怀的美好回忆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0414_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "931d961142ad66b64b19f9d8545d1e5f4cae81a7ee500128b4fdb5e85c106edd", "ja": "それもこれも、{$P$}のおかげです！\nありがとうございました！　へへ……。", "zh": "这一切全都多亏了{$P$}！\n谢谢您！嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0414_1015_p", "source_sha256": "fc75e366a6f845947dad3886db681dbc1b469871077aa3c0e4384eba8be2fe61", "ja": "そこまで言ってもらえるのは嬉しいけど、\nちょっと大げさすぎる気も……。", "zh": "能得到你这样的称赞，我很高兴，不过……感觉也有点太夸张了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0414_1016_006mak", "source_sha256": "567b8e8dd64423602d896d3ed71ab2e3f6a2aac474fda0516a2aa36670d20903", "ja": "そんなことありません！　だって\n{$P$}だから、ボクは……。", "zh": "没那回事！因为是{$P$}，所以我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0414_1017_p", "source_sha256": "479221ffabc720fb69703950c9f5d291e20a0fc05833fe3d3f99292725d40fda", "ja": "真？", "zh": "真的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0414_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "974036f5fb4a0f8d0563916a1fd227df235fb838e8980bac1ffc77f568399aea", "ja": "……ううん、なんでもありません。ただ、漫画の\nヒロインになったみたいだなーと思っただけです！", "zh": "……没什么，什么也没有。只是觉得自己好像变成了漫画里的女主角——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0414_1019_p", "source_sha256": "3b2d973f777dc7105cd79ab3610fc9c695af0a8eecd8740474f93980fdad13fc", "ja": "みたい、じゃなくて、真は立派なヒロインだよ。", "zh": "不是“像”，真本来就是一位出色的女主角。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0414_1020_006mak", "source_sha256": "5683a97cf36009ee610793d36d6227385ac9d04789f27e37f30028f0689ee08a", "ja": "……！　へへっ！　そうだといいなぁ♪　本当に\nありがとうございます、{$P$}♪", "zh": "……！嘿嘿！要是那样就好了♪真的很谢谢您，{$P$}♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
